  "id": "family-constellation",
  "term": "family constellation",
  "definition": "Family constellation, as described here in the context of family constellation therapy, is a systemic, experiential group approach that focuses on patterns in family relationships across generations. It is used to explore how family dynamics, communication problems, and unresolved family trauma may contribute to psychological distress.",
